<title>USA: Dentsply , New Image to merger.</title>
<headline>Dentsply , New Image to merger.</headline>
<dateline>YORK, Penn. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dentsply International Inc and New Image Industries Inc said on Tuesday that they have signed a definitive merger agreement in which Denstply will offer $2.00 per share for all of New Image's outstanding shares.</p>
<p>Dentsply said it would file for a cash tender offer with the Securities and Exchange Commission by February 3.</p>
<p>Following the completion of the merger, New Image will become a wholly-owned subsidiary of Dentsply.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
